  "theme": "must / have to / need to",
  "pillar": "modal",
  "star": false,
  "rule_en": "must = strong obligation from the speaker (and rules). have to = external obligation, and it carries tense: had to, will have to. Negatives differ: mustn't = forbidden; don't have to / don't need to = not necessary.",
  "rule_bn": "must = কঠোর বাধ্যবাধকতা; have to = বাইরের নিয়ম, tense বদলায় (had to / will have to)। mustn't = নিষেধ; don't have to = দরকার নেই — দুটো এক নয়।",
